<title>UK: CRICKET-GLAMORGAN V AUSTRALIA FINAL DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GLAMORGAN V AUSTRALIA FINAL DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third and</p>
<p>final day of a tour match between Glamorgan and Australia on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings  369-4 declared (R.Ponting 126 not</p>
<p>out, M.Taylor 71, J.Langer 50 not out)</p>
<p>Glamorgan first innings 254 (S.James 91; P.Reiffel  5-61)</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 100-5)</p>
<p> M.Slater lbw b Thomas		 7</p>
<p> J.Langer b Parkin		    10</p>
<p> M.Bevan c Metson b Thomas	   1</p>
<p> B.Julian c and b Parkin	    12</p>
<p> D.Berry c Metson b Parkin	   9</p>
<p> P.Reiffel b Thomas		   56</p>
<p> M.Elliott st Metson b Cosker     37</p>
<p> G.Blewett not out		    50</p>
<p> R.Ponting not out		    28</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-4 nb-2)		7</p>
<p>Total (for 7 wickets declared)  217</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-14 2-18 3-26 4-37 5-42 6-122 7-147.</p>
<p>Bowling: Thomas 14-3-42-3, Parkin 15-3-38-3, Cosker</p>
<p>17-3-36-1, Butcher 10-1-36-0, Dale 9-1-43-0, Maynard 4-0-17-0.</p>
